      "content": "That's a good start. But I feel like it's a bit too \"on the nose\" with the word \"traditional.\" Can you make it more persuasive? Like, instead of just saying they're beneficial, maybe frame it so it's clear that other modern setups just don't offer that same level of stability or what kids actually need to thrive?",
